Grouped by concern. Note the reordering in priority (not folder location) — `styling/` and its baseline comparison are now the primary deliverable, and `architecture/` exists largely to **support and contextualize** that deliverable (e.g. "this styling drift is in a component 12 other pages depend on, so it's high-impact").

